# Public Skill Node Closed Loop

## Purpose

This is the first concrete closed loop for the Capability Internet Protocol.

## Scenario

A public Skill Node exposes a code review capability.

A Human or Agent invokes it.

The Skill Node returns result and proof.

A Verifier / Reviewer validates it.

Settlement and reputation are updated.

## Flow

```text
Skill Entity created
→ NodeProfile registered
→ Public endpoint manifest published
→ Capability published
→ Agent discovers capability
→ Signed invocation sent
→ Skill executes review
→ Output hash returned
→ Proof submitted
→ Verification completed
→ Settlement executed
→ TokenAccount updated
→ ReputationGraph updated
→ ProtocolEvents appended
```
